rpmini-bsp (0.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The OS side is now "hako": the session and development packages moved to
    hako-base (hako-session, hako-dev). This package keeps the board support
    only and adds /usr/lib/hako/session.d/10-rpmini.sh (HAKO_ROTATE=270, pad
    mapping) and /usr/lib/hako/hw/volume.
  * Touch rotation rule and WirePlumber settings moved here from the session.

