rpmini-bsp (0.1.6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * rpmini-session: PipeWire + WirePlumber in the session. WirePlumber config:
    S16LE on the q6 front ends (S24_LE played ~48 dB too quiet), fixed hardware
    gain (soft-mixer), 70 % initial volume.
  * Volume keys change the PipeWire volume of the default output; hardware
    gain only as a fallback without PipeWire.

